<title> Achilles Pain: Diagnosis.</title>
<graphic href="eee0374-w0001.gif" />
<cell type="start" id="cell-1">
<label>Posterior heel pain Location?</label>
<path target="cell-4">At Achilles insertion</path>
<path target="cell-11">3-4 cm above Achilles insertion</path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-4">
<label>X-ray</label>
<path target="cell-5">Fracture</path>
<path target="cell-6">No fracture</path>
<path target="cell-7">Haglund's deformity</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-5">
<label>Treat stress fracture or acute fracture</label>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-6">
<label>Site and type of pain</label>
<path target="cell-8">Tender anterior to tendon or at edge of tendon</path>
<path target="cell-9">Deep tenderness at insertion</path>
<path target="cell-10">Superficial tenderness at insertion</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-8">
<label>Retrocalcaneal bursitis</label>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-9">
<label>Achilles enthesopathy</label>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-10">
<label>Adventitial Achilles bursitis</label>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-7">
<label>Worse prognosis with conservative therapy</label>
<path target="cell-6"></path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-11">
<label>Acute onset</label>
<path target="cell-12">No</path>
<path target="cell-13">Yes</path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-12">
<label>Tenderness at tendon neck (3-4 cm above insertion)</label>
<path target="cell-14">No</path>
<path target="cell-15">Yes</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-14">
<label>Consider ultrasound and trial of conservative therapy</label>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-15">
<label>Achilles tendinosis</label>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-13">
<label>Positive Thompson test?</label>
<path target="cell-12">No</path>
<path target="cell-16">Yes</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-16">
<label>Achilles tendon rupture</label>
</cell>
</algorithm>
</algorithms>
